                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                    <div style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #144d37; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-boxes-stacked"></i> Tray Reconciliation Data
