                            </label>
                            <input type="text" id="reconTrayType" value="Standard Trays" style="width: 100%; padding: 8px 12px; border: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 13.5px; color: #1e293b; background: #fff; outline: none; box-sizing: border-box;">
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <label style="display: block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 4px;">
